{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.poster.avif?t=1755621941\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.webm?t=1755621941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.mp4?t=1755621941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Ravaged World, an Underwater War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after a catastrophic war, Earth\u2019s surface lies in ruins. Humans lost the war on land, but it continues on in the depths below. Now, two unlikely heroes must venture into the treacherous waters where it all began - Rusted Sea - to infiltrate the heart of the Robotic Regime and prevent humanity\u2019s extinction once and for all.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Protagonists</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Cade Callahan, a stranded sub pilot\u2014and his daring rescue partner and 'WingedWoman' - Finn the penguin. Team up  to survive and succeed.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radioactive Resource Mining</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a robotic claw to collect rare Nukelium\u2014its power is essential, but its radiation draws deadly BotFish.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Sea Creature Abilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield Orca Echolocation and other marine powers via \u201cFINNFLUENCE\u201d to solve puzzles, find objectives, and overcome the enemy.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Combat &amp; Tactical Encounters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in undersea battles against swarms of BotFish. Use environment, creature powers, and innovation to survive.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle &amp; Exploration-Driven Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate deep-sea canyons, manage your resources, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover hidden facilities.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save  Humanity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With time\u2014and oxygen\u2014running out, the fate of our species lies in your hands, (and wings).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visually Distinct &amp; Atmospheric</strong><br>Hand-drawn 2D art, colorful yet eerie underwater landscapes, and atmospheric audio design\u2014immerse yourself in a melancholy world where hope glints beneath rust.   </h2></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2722780?t=1755621941","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755621941","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/d6e3a773a0cfb9859e750e5a1c009d8ce26874ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755621941","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/d6e3a773a0cfb9859e750e5a1c009d8ce26874ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755621941","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.poster.avif?t=1755621941\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.webm?t=1755621941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.mp4?t=1755621941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Ravaged World, an Underwater War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after a catastrophic war, Earth\u2019s surface lies in ruins. Humans lost the war on land, but it continues on in the depths below. Now, two unlikely heroes must venture into the treacherous waters where it all began - Rusted Sea - to infiltrate the heart of the Robotic Regime and prevent humanity\u2019s extinction once and for all.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Protagonists</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Cade Callahan, a stranded sub pilot\u2014and his daring rescue partner and 'WingedWoman' - Finn the penguin. Team up  to survive and succeed.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radioactive Resource Mining</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a robotic claw to collect rare Nukelium\u2014its power is essential, but its radiation draws deadly BotFish.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Sea Creature Abilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield Orca Echolocation and other marine powers via \u201cFINNFLUENCE\u201d to solve puzzles, find objectives, and overcome the enemy.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Combat &amp; Tactical Encounters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in undersea battles against swarms of BotFish. Use environment, creature powers, and innovation to survive.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle &amp; Exploration-Driven Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate deep-sea canyons, manage your resources, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover hidden facilities.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save  Humanity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With time\u2014and oxygen\u2014running out, the fate of our species lies in your hands, (and wings).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visually Distinct &amp; Atmospheric</strong><br>Hand-drawn 2D art, colorful yet eerie underwater landscapes, and atmospheric audio design\u2014immerse yourself in a melancholy world where hope glints beneath rust.   </h2></li></ul></li></ul>","developers":["Meerkatapult Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/bb4897ebe2bfe3044e5550dcea303546407ad344/header.jpg?t=1755621941","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2722780/1133033104/0341cd8b8408c4aa64e44069d15415b4c001d592/1750894246/dash_av1.mpd?t=174